## Data Cleaning Log

| No. | Check | Reason | Action |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Duplicate IDs | Check whether any listings appear more than once | No duplicate IDs found. No action needed. |
| 2 | Price format | Convert prices from text to numbers | Removed `$` signs and commas and converted the `price` column to `float64`. Checked 56,873 rows. |
| 3 | Missing prices | Remove listings without usable prices | Removed 5,009 rows with missing prices. 51,864 rows remained. |
| 4 | Bathroom format | Convert bathroom descriptions into numerical values | Processed 60 rows with text descriptions, extracted bathroom counts, and represented half-baths as 0.5. Remaining missing values were kept as NaN. |
| 5 | Amenities | Make amenity information easier to analyze | Created an `amenities_count` column from the amenities data. |
| 6 | Missing bedrooms | Check incomplete bedroom information | Kept 7,859 missing bedroom values as NaN. |
| 7 | Invalid ratings | Check ratings below the valid 1–5 range | Changed 2 invalid ratings to NaN. |
| 8 | Missing ratings | Handle listings without review scores | Found 14,499 listings with zero reviews, kept 2 listings with missing ratings as NaN. |
| 9 | Missing minimum nights | Check for incomplete minimum-stay information | Kept 1 missing value as NaN. |
| 10 | Long minimum stays | Identify minimum stays exceeding 365 nights | Four listings had values above 365 nights, but they had already been removed in step 3. Added `minimum_nights_flag`, no remaining rows were flagged. |
| 11 | Geographic coordinates | Check whether listings were outside the Sicily region, including islands | No rows were removed. |
| 12 | High prices per guest | Identify prices above $2,000 per guest per night | Removed 7 listings. 51,857 rows remained. |
| 13 | Low prices | Identify prices below $10 per night | Removed 9 listings. 51,848 rows remained. |
| 14 | Price outliers | Identify unusually high prices within each room type | Used the IQR method to flag 4,724 listings in `price_outlier`. These listings were retained. |

**Final dataset:** 51,848 rows and 18 columns.
